== field_order, luau -O2, run 1
check: 16 pooled orders and the per-session RMW order round-trip
## encode one 78-bit record (400000 iters x 11 rounds)
case                                median ns        min        max    ratio     rmin     rmax
gen seed0 (straight line)              339.08     308.60     448.85     1.00     1.00     1.00
gen rotated (per-build order)          324.40     297.99     464.18     1.02     0.92     1.24
gen pool, lookup per message           334.38     309.79     507.05     1.05     0.91     1.29
gen pool, bound per session            330.74     303.32     495.71     1.00     0.89     1.23
table-driven, name order               605.02     563.27     989.98     1.82     1.55     2.77
table-driven, per-session order        752.39     575.87    1000.32     2.02     1.78     2.79
gen RMW, constant offsets              333.16     310.43     500.20     1.03     0.77     1.47
gen RMW, per-session offsets           363.66     334.15     503.47     1.06     0.81     1.48
## decode one 78-bit record (server, per player) (400000 iters x 11 rounds)
case                                median ns        min        max    ratio     rmin     rmax
gen seed0                              248.28     235.41     315.37     1.00     1.00     1.00
gen pool, lookup per message           251.25     221.38     287.12     0.99     0.75     1.16
gen per-session offsets (closure)      258.19     243.25     357.04     1.05     0.77     1.43
table-driven, per-session order        569.36     520.96     788.27     2.32     1.74     3.04
## encode 3-field byte record (original writeHit) (400000 iters x 11 rounds)
case                                median ns        min        max    ratio     rmin     rmax
straight line (seed 0)                  73.70      67.87      82.80     1.00     1.00     1.00
closure table (original runtime)       164.42     155.58     194.64     2.24     2.11     2.77
straight line, per-session offsets      86.21      72.45     121.79     1.22     0.98     1.59
sink	2869201390605
